{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L1RoZS1FdGVybmF1dC0yMDI1Lw","type":"series","name":"The Eternaut","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ucI5KroZLP0KyJqQnAdOpzhVvBs.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yMjGzK7L4gwzpQNNtFKDeG79upo.jpg","description":"After a devastating toxic snowfall kills millions, Juan Salvo and a group of survivors in Buenos Aires must resist an invisible threat from another world.\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 6/6","releaseInfo":"2025","genres":["Drama","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L1RoZS1FdGVybmF1dC0yMDI1Lw.1.1","title":"A Night of Cards","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2025-04-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"An eerie snowfall disrupts Juan's card night with friends. As tensions rise, they craft a suit for him to brave the storm and find his daughter.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yXje7npgrNtAdx9FPwuwHuO9O8Z.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L1RoZS1FdGVybmF1dC0yMDI1Lw.1.2","title":"Step into the Sun","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2025-04-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Salvo braves a ravaged Buenos Aires to reach Elena and Clara's apartment, discovering that human survival instincts can be as deadly as the toxic snow.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xGl6Ctm1trLI6wyFpZdcWv67vn6.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L1RoZS1FdGVybmF1dC0yMDI1Lw.1.3","title":"Magnetism","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2025-04-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Searching Clara's school for clues, Juan and Elena meet Pablo, a student in distress. Meanwhile, Tano attempts radio contact as Juan's visions intensify.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4UEANa319Zgt2r2KHJzzQ0CZKub.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5